      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Tensor Unit",
      "source_hash": 3977201216570033620,
      "context_hash": 14017911728982866847,
      "translation": "Tensor Unit",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Tensor Unit": "Tensor Unit"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558194Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Tensor Unit is the on-chip compute pipeline.",
      "source_hash": 10785017718205739880,
      "context_hash": 1547178928709681544,
      "translation": "Tensor Unit은 Chip 내부의 연산 파이프라인입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Chip": "Chip",
        "Tensor Unit": "Tensor Unit",
        "pipeline": "파이프라인"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558194Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It reads tensor data from DM, transforms it through ten engines, and writes results back to DM.",
      "source_hash": 4342391102977995599,
      "context_hash": 8387502957194757350,
      "translation": "Tensor Unit은 DM에서 텐서 데이터를 읽고, 10개의 엔진을 거쳐 변환한 뒤, 결과를 다시 DM에 씁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DM": "DM"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558194Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Each tensor flows through the pipeline as a stream of packets, one packet per cycle.",
      "source_hash": 7276372377846490562,
      "context_hash": 2004734988958504989,
      "translation": "각 텐서는 사이클당 하나의 패킷씩, 패킷 스트림 형태로 파이프라인을 통과합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pipeline": "파이프라인"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558195Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The engines consume and produce these streams, reshaping the per-cycle layout and the iteration order along the way.",
      "source_hash": 3891963977906441559,
      "context_hash": 18284285273588746689,
      "translation": "엔진들은 이러한 스트림을 소비하고 생성하며, 그 과정에서 사이클별 레이아웃과 반복 순서를 재구성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558195Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "The Collect Engine normalizes incoming packets to 32-byte *flits*.",
      "source_hash": 13453048425684354113,
      "context_hash": 2705976833933862397,
      "translation": "Collect Engine은 들어오는 패킷을 32바이트 *플릿*(flit)으로 정규화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Collect Engine": "Collect Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558195Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "Every downstream engine operates on these flits.",
      "source_hash": 12121437144882263984,
      "context_hash": 15766887970663290744,
      "translation": "이후의 모든 엔진은 이 플릿을 대상으로 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558195Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:4",
      "source": "The pipeline includes Contraction, Vector, Cast, Transpose, Commit Adapter, and Commit.",
      "source_hash": 3524007969245434867,
      "context_hash": 8876777972408046841,
      "translation": "파이프라인에는 Contraction, Vector, Cast, Transpose, Commit Adapter, Commit이 포함됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Commit Adapter": "Commit Adapter",
        "pipeline": "파이프라인"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558195Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:5",
      "source": "See the linked engine pages for [Contraction](./contraction-engine/index.md), [Vector](./vector-engine/index.md), [Cast](./cast-engine.md), [Transpose](./transpose-engine.md), [Commit Adapter](./commit-adapter.md), and [Commit](../moving-tensors/commit-engine.md).",
      "source_hash": 11815753653272960117,
      "context_hash": 16772888901164730472,
      "translation": "링크된 엔진 페이지 [Contraction](./contraction-engine/index.md), [Vector](./vector-engine/index.md), [Cast](./cast-engine.md), [Transpose](./transpose-engine.md), [Commit Adapter](./commit-adapter.md), [Commit](../moving-tensors/commit-engine.md)을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Commit Adapter": "Commit Adapter"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:30.558196Z",
      "issues": []
