    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Packet must be 8-byte aligned. `Slice` is preserved unless [axis lifting](../moving-tensors/fetch-engine.md#axis-lifting) replaces a broadcast with an axis from `Time`",
