    {
      "id": "section:2/block:37/seg:0",
      "source": "Each tensor stream inside the Tensor Unit carries five dimensions, `[Chip, Cluster, Slice, Time, Packet]`, that split into two groups. `Chip`, `Cluster`, and `Slice` are spatial dimensions: each slice runs its own pipeline instance, with slices grouped by cluster and clusters grouped by chip. `Time` and `Packet` describe the per-slice stream (see [Spatial and Temporal Dimensions](../mapping-tensors/spatial-temporal-dimensions.md) for the definitions).",
      "source_hash": 3871187769419740800,
      "context_hash": 17189678398045657880,
      "translation": "Tensor Unit 내부의 각 텐서 스트림은 `[Chip, Cluster, Slice, Time, Packet]`의 다섯 차원을 가지며, 이 차원은 두 그룹으로 나뉩니다. `Chip`, `Cluster`, `Slice`는 공간 차원입니다. 각 Slice는 자체 파이프라인 인스턴스를 실행하며, Slice는 Cluster 단위로, Cluster는 Chip 단위로 묶입니다. `Time`과 `Packet`은 Slice별 스트림을 나타냅니다(정의는 [공간 차원과 시간 차원](../mapping-tensors/spatial-temporal-dimensions.md)을 참조하십시오).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pipeline": "파이프라인",
        "dimensions": "차원",
        "Chip": "Chip",
        "Cluster": "Cluster",
        "Slice": "Slice",
        "Spatial and Temporal Dimensions": "공간 차원과 시간 차원",
        "Tensor Unit": "Tensor Unit"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925064Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:37/seg:1",
      "source": "The engines above reshape `Time` / `Packet` along the pipeline.",
      "source_hash": 4346113353622026229,
      "context_hash": 11238179600536412045,
      "translation": "위의 엔진들은 파이프라인을 따라 `Time` / `Packet`의 형태를 바꿉니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pipeline": "파이프라인"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925064Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:37/seg:2",
      "source": "Most engines preserve the spatial dimensions. [Switch](./switch-engine.md) moves data across slices.",
      "source_hash": 467355796090425855,
      "context_hash": 4387244546107016532,
      "translation": "대부분의 엔진은 공간 차원을 유지합니다. [Switch](./switch-engine.md)는 Slice 간에 데이터를 이동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimensions": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925064Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:37/seg:3",
      "source": "Fetch's [axis lifting](../moving-tensors/fetch-engine.md#axis-lifting) assigns different DM read offsets along `Chip`, `Cluster`, or `Slice`, moving an axis out of `Time`.",
      "source_hash": 6561390193088733382,
      "context_hash": 15569731341349694554,
      "translation": "Fetch의 [축 리프팅](../moving-tensors/fetch-engine.md#axis-lifting)은 `Chip`, `Cluster` 또는 `Slice`를 따라 서로 다른 DM 읽기 오프셋을 할당하여 축을 `Time` 밖으로 옮깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "lifting": "리프팅",
        "axis": "축",
        "DM": "DM"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:37/seg:4",
      "source": "The [Vector inter-slice reducer](./vector-engine/inter-slice-reducer.md) combines the 256 slices in a cluster.",
      "source_hash": 182307648704700884,
      "context_hash": 11087193007055172986,
      "translation": "[Vector Inter-Slice Reducer](./vector-engine/inter-slice-reducer.md)는 Cluster 내의 256개 Slice를 결합합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Inter-Slice Reducer": "Inter-Slice Reducer",
        "Cluster": "Cluster"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:38/seg:0",
      "source": "The Contraction and Vector Engines each take one operand from the pipeline stream and the other operand from a dedicated per-slice register file.",
      "source_hash": 16747124574725590979,
      "context_hash": 17759569211078391735,
      "translation": "Contraction Engine과 Vector Engine은 각각 한 피연산자를 파이프라인 스트림에서, 다른 피연산자를 Slice별 전용 Register File에서 가져옵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pipeline": "파이프라인",
        "Slice": "Slice",
        "Register File": "Register File"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:38/seg:1",
      "source": "TRF (Tensor Register File) feeds the Contraction Engine, and VRF (Vector Register File) feeds the Vector Engine.",
      "source_hash": 1347574156764006726,
      "context_hash": 8483849709848411046,
      "translation": "TRF(Tensor Register File)는 Contraction Engine에 데이터를 공급하고, VRF(Vector Register File)는 Vector Engine에 데이터를 공급합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Register File": "Register File",
        "Contraction Engine": "Contraction Engine",
        "Vector Engine": "Vector Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:38/seg:2",
      "source": "The Collect Engine writes into TRF via `.to_trf()` and into VRF via `.to_vrf()`.",
      "source_hash": 17070570643924061002,
      "context_hash": 8047096034413553424,
      "translation": "Collect Engine은 `.to_trf()`를 통해 TRF에, `.to_vrf()`를 통해 VRF에 씁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Collect Engine": "Collect Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:38/seg:3",
      "source": "For an end-to-end example using both files, see [Quick Start](../quick-start.md).",
      "source_hash": 14104441888481982325,
      "context_hash": 7213007759635769013,
      "translation": "두 Register File을 모두 사용하는 엔드투엔드 예제는 [빠른 시작](../quick-start.md)을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Quick Start": "빠른 시작"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925065Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:39/seg:0",
      "source": "Fetch reads from DM and Commit writes back to DM.",
      "source_hash": 2963055809854903770,
      "context_hash": 15429333880666265472,
      "translation": "Fetch는 DM에서 읽고 Commit은 DM에 다시 씁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DM": "DM"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:39/seg:1",
      "source": "Their detailed sequencer behavior is documented in [Moving Tensors](../moving-tensors/index.md) rather than here.",
      "source_hash": 8235231076686688214,
      "context_hash": 7370716530945038592,
      "translation": "이들의 상세한 Sequencer 동작은 여기가 아닌 [텐서 이동](../moving-tensors/index.md)에서 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Moving Tensors": "텐서 이동",
        "Sequencer": "Sequencer"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Execution Context",
      "source_hash": 4188194125420344578,
      "context_hash": 14150016128337306040,
      "translation": "실행 컨텍스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The [scheduler](../scheduling/schedule.md#execution-contexts) treats each *execution context* as an independent stream of operations.",
      "source_hash": 17554984643243194620,
      "context_hash": 13699643574007884126,
      "translation": "[스케줄러](../scheduling/schedule.md#execution-contexts)는 각 *실행 컨텍스트*를 독립적인 연산 스트림으로 취급합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The hardware exposes three:",
      "source_hash": 9847078629948778867,
      "context_hash": 2628369960839561303,
      "translation": "하드웨어는 다음 세 가지 실행 컨텍스트를 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Main** drives the Tensor Unit pipeline for the kernel's primary computation.",
      "source_hash": 17968884648822630662,
      "context_hash": 15612039555738315037,
      "translation": "**Main**은 커널의 주요 연산을 위해 Tensor Unit 파이프라인을 구동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pipeline": "파이프라인",
        "Tensor Unit": "Tensor Unit"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Sub** drives a subset of the same pipeline, typically prefetching operands into TRF / VRF while main computes.",
      "source_hash": 10608806430815460382,
      "context_hash": 12296712352309589204,
      "translation": "**Sub**는 같은 파이프라인의 일부를 구동하며, 일반적으로 Main이 연산하는 동안 피연산자를 TRF / VRF로 미리 가져옵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pipeline": "파이프라인"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**DMA** drives the DMA Engine alone, external to the Tensor Unit.",
      "source_hash": 15106822577041778802,
      "context_hash": 12486789832344979791,
      "translation": "**DMA**는 Tensor Unit 외부에서 DMA Engine만 단독으로 구동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Tensor Unit": "Tensor Unit",
        "DMA Engine": "DMA Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The main context can drive every Tensor Unit engine.",
      "source_hash": 3023531655496747106,
      "context_hash": 2115038213565035490,
      "translation": "Main 컨텍스트는 모든 Tensor Unit 엔진을 구동할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Tensor Unit": "Tensor Unit"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925066Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "The sub context drops the Contraction Engine and a handful of other features.",
      "source_hash": 18050169840151567452,
      "context_hash": 3137801301105998305,
      "translation": "Sub 컨텍스트에서는 Contraction Engine과 몇 가지 다른 기능을 사용할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Contraction Engine": "Contraction Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925067Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "Everything else carries over from main.",
      "source_hash": 689626518785462924,
      "context_hash": 12253919610058446057,
      "translation": "그 외의 모든 것은 Main과 동일하게 적용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:54:31.925067Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Context ordering, overlap, resource conflicts, and memory-rule scheduling are defined in [Schedule](../scheduling/schedule.md).",
      "source_hash": 5988458209408843233,
      "context_hash": 3410664979642826131,
      "translation": "컨텍스트 순서, 중첩, 리소스 충돌, 메모리 규칙 스케줄링은 [스케줄](../scheduling/schedule.md)에서 정의합니다.",
